  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Sixfold Shot replaces Quickdraw without learned-spell alerts or duplicate spellbook entries (#2912)",
  "contract": [
    "The level-50 passive 500567 says every fifth Darkslayer or Shadowblast transforms Quickdraw into Sixfold",
    "Shot. This is a temporary replacement of one spellbook slot, not another learned ability: a superseded-spell",
    "packet delivers the transformed spell, and no learned-spell alert should accompany it. Quickdraw remains",
    "known on the server throughout, returns on consumption or expiry, and an eligible normal Quickdraw can",
    "interrupt Sixfold Shot. This scenario earns five stacks with normal critical Shadowblasts, checks exactly",
    "one client spellbook copy and no learned-spell alerts, then interrupts the earned Sixfold channel with a",
    "normally proc-enabled Quickdraw. A second transformation is earned normally and left to expire, proving",
    "restoration and the same single-slot/no-alert contract across repeated cycles. Shadowblast has DmgClass3",
    "(ranged) and projectile speed40 in Spell.dbc, so ranged critical rating is fixture-maxed and its naturally",
    "earned Quickdraw proc is observed after the projectile impact."
  ],
